#: R/cox.b.R
msgid ""
"C-index: probability that, of two patients, the one who has the event first "
"has the higher predicted risk (0.5 = chance, 1 = perfect)."
msgstr ""
"Índex C: probabilitat que, de dos pacients, el que presenta abans "
"l'esdeveniment tingui el risc predit més alt (0.5 = atzar, 1 = perfecte)."

