#: km/options/tests/taroneware.title
msgid "Tarone-Ware"
msgstr "Tarone-Ware"

#: R/cox.b.R
msgid ""
"Test based on Schoenfeld residuals; a small p suggests that the hazard ratio "
"changes over time (non-proportional hazards)."
msgstr ""
"Prova basada en els residus de Schoenfeld; una p petita suggereix que el "
"hazard ratio canvia amb el temps (riscos no proporcionals)."

#: km/options/pvalPlot.title
msgid "Test p-value"
msgstr "Valor p de la prova"

